.TH MAINUAN-KERNEL-INSTALLER 1 "2026-11-07" "1.1.0" "Mainuan Kernel Installer Manual"
.SH NAME
mainuan-kernel-installer \- A graphical interface for downloading, compiling and installing the Linux kernel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mainuan-kernel-installer
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mainuan-kernel-installer
is a GTK3 application designed to simplify the process of obtaining, configuring, and installing the Linux kernel. It supports multiple optimization profiles (Gaming, Audio/Video, Minimal, Hardware Optimized), a hardware test that recommends a compatible kernel, installation and removal of pre-built RT, LTS and XanMod kernels, and removal of any installed kernel. It is compatible with major Linux distributions.
.SH OPTIONS
This application does not take any command line options.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit the application.
.TP
.B F5
Refresh available kernel versions.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/mainuan-kernel-installer/
Application data and logic.
.TP
.I ~/.kernel_installer_history.json
Installation history file.
